WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.331
This is Handshake: a safe way to buy from a stranger. Here's one real deal, from both sides at once. The buyer is on the left, and the seller is on the right.

2
00:00:11.933 --> 00:00:17.468
Sam wants to sell his Nintendo Switch. He pastes the link to his listing.

3
00:00:17.833 --> 00:00:27.949
A cloud browser from Kernel opens the page, and reads the price and the photos. Then Claude, the AI, checks every word for the tricks that scammers use.

4
00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:36.537
No red flags. Channel3 compares the price with real stores, so a fair price looks fair, and a bait price stands out.

5
00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:45.188
The photos are Sam's own, not copied from a shop. And Elastic checks Handshake's memory of every scam it has seen. No match.

6
00:00:45.533 --> 00:00:54.886
Sam creates a protected deal, and sets a secret lowest price of one hundred and eighty-nine dollars. Only he, and his AI agent, can see it.

7
00:00:55.233 --> 00:00:59.830
He sends the link to the buyer, who opens it on the other side.

8
00:01:00.167 --> 00:01:10.681
The buyer makes an offer, with a secret maximum of two hundred and five dollars. PayPal holds that money, so Sam knows the offer is real. But nothing is charged yet.

9
00:01:11.033 --> 00:01:21.093
Now two AI agents negotiate, live, using real market prices. Each one argues for its owner, and code keeps both of them inside their limits.

10
00:01:21.433 --> 00:01:29.774
They agree on one hundred and ninety-five dollars. That's twenty-five less than asking, and it's the only amount that can ever be charged.

11
00:01:30.133 --> 00:01:39.657
Sam ships to the buyer's PayPal-verified address. From here, every deadline runs on its own, on Render, even if nobody opens the page.

12
00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:45.244
The Switch arrives just as described, so the buyer releases the payment.

13
00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:57.276
PayPal captures exactly one hundred and ninety-five dollars, and pays Sam one hundred and eighty-nine dollars and forty-six cents, after fees. No cash. No chasing. No scam.

14
00:01:57.633 --> 00:02:05.591
Handshake. Buy from strangers, and keep your money. Powered by PayPal, with Channel3, Render, Kernel, and Elastic.
